:"She’s also a virgin, despite most witches getting their magic from sleeping with a demon..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18429"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70f336c412819921a694f18c8aa2a374e946ec0334903ce2419693ce591663c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb6db8b8efb818250fd1e4b0af112d64fdaf14b9bfad97028408e4df43e1f48b.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷室 百合","creatorId":"vndb:s694","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s694","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s694","name":"ひむろゆり(氷室百合)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:37436","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c18430","characterName":"メイジー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c18430"},"originalCharacterName":"メイジー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maisie is a mischievous fairy which April sealed away in a book. Despite being pint-sized, she’s not your typical fairy, with a personality just as treacherous, caustic, and brutal as April’s. Maisie is also capable of becoming human-sized (albeit as a loli), which helps during the training scenes..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Seeking retribution for her years of incarceration at April’s hands, Maisie offers a Denis a deal: ”Remove this seal, and I’ll grant you the power to revenge yourself against April.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c18430"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d